    "title": "\"Be careful\": Texoma rancher has warning after losing $8,000 of hay - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Austin Hedgcoth ,\n24 minutes ago MARIETTA, Oklahoma (KXII) - A Marietta rancher has a warning for other hay suppliers after losing $8,000 worth of alfalfa hay to a man who paid with a fake check. “I hope he gets caught,” rancher Nick Blayney said, “but my main goal, I’m just wanting to make people aware of him.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
